  mortgage_tp_effective_rate_what: 'The effective rate shows the real yearly price of the loan. It takes the interest and adds the costs the bank makes you pay to get the loan, such as the issuing fee, required insurance and service fees. In Georgia banks must show it, so you can compare offers fairly.',
