  /* ── GRACE_PERIOD ─────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  mortgage_tp_grace_period_what: 'A grace period is a time at the start of the loan, often a few months, when you pay only the interest (or sometimes nothing). It is useful when you buy a flat that is still being built, or while you are renovating and paying rent.',
