  mortgage_tp_down_payment_what: 'The down payment is the part of the price you pay with your own money. The bank lends you the rest. In Georgia there is a minimum, because the National Bank limits how much of the price a loan can cover.',
  mortgage_tp_down_payment_why: 'A bigger down payment means a smaller loan, a smaller monthly payment and much less interest. It also makes approval easier and can get you a better rate.',
